Package: gi-ai
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Suggests: man-db
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/@GH_USER@/gi-ai
Description: Ĝi - a small, private AI assistant that runs on your computer
 Ĝi answers questions using a language model running locally (for example
 through Ollama or LM Studio) and keeps a private workspace of task records
 with a tamper-evident audit log. It sends nothing over the network except to
 the local model endpoint you configure.
